<title>POLAND: KROSNO FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>KROSNO FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.76 vs   0.82</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.36 vs   1.21</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.55 vs   1.41</p>
<p> Sales		   15.53 vs  14.19</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.29 vs   1.84</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.27 vs   2.71</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.57 vs   3.03</p>
<p> Sales		   29.33 vs  28.36</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish glass maker is Krosnienskie Huty</p>
<p>Szkla Krosno SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
